text:
I saw Oppenheimer on Thursday and after seeing the J. Robby Oppy/Jean Tatlock sex scenes, I was wondering if you could think of any other films about a historical figure/famous person that had a sex scene in it? I feel like normally an innuendo would be used for a scene like that, thought Einstein might be knocking boots next!

&amp;#x200B;

&amp;#x200B;

